          "text": "Description: On April 30, 1977, between 11:00 PM and 11:25 PM, witnesses observed a glow and heard a crackling or whistling sound. The gendarmerie was late notified of these events and was unable to find any trace or clue at the scene. Testimonies differ on many details, and the facts could not be determined with precision.",
